-- PRE-STAGED ONLY. DO NOT APPLY DURING FEATURE FREEZE.
-- Mission #18 independent fail-closed cleanup contract.
-- Purpose: authority reduction only if normal finalize cannot complete after the one-request slot has been consumed.
-- Re-read live schema and review exact column/status semantics before activation.

-- REQUIRED Production function after Stabilization Exit:
--   public.pm_internet_transport_proof_emergency_relock_v1(uuid,text)
-- Inputs:
--   p_command_id uuid  : exact VERIFIED transport-proof Owner command
--   p_reason text      : bounded executor/finalize failure reason for audit only
-- SECURITY DEFINER; EXECUTE service_role only; PUBLIC/anon/authenticated revoked.

-- MANDATORY EFFECTS, atomically where feasible:
-- 1. Lock CONTROLLED_INTERNET_GATEWAY row FOR UPDATE.
-- 2. Set owner_lockdown_active=true.
-- 3. Set production_network_enabled=false unconditionally.
-- 4. Set gateway mode back to SHADOW_ONLY / non-network operational state.
-- 5. Disable CONTROLLED_INTERNET_TRANSPORT_PROOF lane.
-- 6. Never decrement network_request_count, never clear consumed request token, never reopen a slot.
-- 7. Revoke/expire every active PAOJAI_OPERATIONS_AI PUBLIC_READ grant tied to p_command_id.
-- 8. Do not create any grant, command, nonce, approval, unlock, reservation, or network authority.
-- 9. Preserve request/audit/provenance evidence and append emergency-relock audit evidence.
-- 10. Be idempotent: repeated calls can only maintain/reduce authority, never restore it.

-- AUTHORITY REQUIREMENT:
-- Emergency relock is an authority-reducing kill-switch path. It must not depend on caller-supplied
-- signature_verified or on the proof window still being open. It may use p_command_id solely to scope
-- revocation/audit, but failure to resolve the command must still force gateway lockdown + general-network=false + lane disabled.

-- FAIL-CLOSED GUARANTEE:
-- Once the reservation has been acquired, any executor/finalize exception must attempt normal finalize once.
-- If finalize errors or cannot prove cleanup completion, executor must call emergency relock before returning.
-- Failure of both finalize and emergency relock is CRITICAL and must be surfaced as cleanup_verified=false.
-- No automatic proof retry is allowed; the consumed slot remains consumed and fresh review/Owner approval is required.

-- POST-CALL VERIFICATION MUST PROVE:
-- owner_lockdown_active=true
-- production_network_enabled=false
-- proof lane enabled=false
-- active PAOJAI PUBLIC_READ grants for the command = 0
-- consumed request token/slot remains consumed
-- Recovery/Kill-Switch + Central/Action/Guardian + authority checks pass before closure.
